# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.mypy_cache/
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.coverage*
coverage.xml
htmlcov/
pytest.xml

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Editors and OS
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.idea/
.vscode/
.ipynb_checkpoints/
*.swp
*~
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Local Spark / Delta run artifacts
#
# Spark writes these into the current working directory when nothing points it
# elsewhere — running pytest from the repo root leaves them in the tree. The
# session fixture in tests/conftest.py now redirects the warehouse to a temp
# dir; these entries cover a run started some other way.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
spark-warehouse/
metastore_db/
derby.log
conf/
checkpoint/
*.jar
*.log

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Local scratch and generated reports
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
temp*.json
temp*.txt
temp*.md
*.bak_*
# Graphviz output from the plan/lineage helpers.
*.dot
*.svg

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Sample data
#
# The small AdventureWorks Delta tables under data/ ARE tracked — the example
# scripts read them straight from a clone. Everything below is generated by a
# local run or too large to carry.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
data/Logs
data/Staging
data/Target
data/_DeltaCatalog/
data/IoT_DeviceRegistry_delta/
data/IoT_DeviceRegistry_delta_1M/
data/IoT_DeviceRegistry_delta_1B/
data/IoT_/

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# .claude/notes/ — agent working notes. todo.md and lessons.md are the two
# deliberate exceptions; everything else here (todo archives, scratch) is local.
#
# Note the `.claude/notes/*` form: git cannot re-include a file whose parent
# directory is itself excluded, so `.claude/notes/` + `!.claude/notes/todo.md`
# would silently keep both ignored.
#
# docs/ — project-wide user documentation — is fully tracked, not listed here.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.claude/notes/*
!.claude/notes/lessons.md
!.claude/notes/todo.md
!.claude/notes/lessons-archive.md
!.claude/notes/todo-archive-*.md

